{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03111","headline":"奉和圣制龙池篇 · 张九龄","name":"奉和圣制龙池篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天啓神龙生碧泉，泉水灵源浸迤延。\n飞龙已向珠潭出，积水仍将银汉连。\n岸傍花柳看胜画，浦上楼台问是仙。\n我后元符从此得，方爲万岁寿图川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}